// Your own {{language}} snippets, in the format of VS Code (and of friendly-snippets).
// They are read again when this file is saved. friendly-snippets is replaced when it is
// updated; this file is yours and is never touched.
//
// A snippet with the same prefix as one of friendly-snippets takes its place.
//
//   "prefix":      what you type (a string, or a list of them)
//   "body":        what it becomes (a string, or a list of lines). Tab moves through
//                  $1, $2 or ${1:default}; $0 is where the cursor ends. Variables:
//                  $TM_FILENAME, $CURRENT_YEAR, $CURRENT_DATE, $UUID, $CLIPBOARD, ...
//   "description": shown in the completion list (optional)
//
// Other files in this directory: <language>.json (c.json, python.json),
// <extension>.json for files no language is known for, all.json for every file.
// Comments like these, and a comma after the last item, are allowed.
{
  // "todo": {
  //   "prefix": "todo",
  //   "body": "$LINE_COMMENT TODO($CURRENT_YEAR-$CURRENT_MONTH-$CURRENT_DATE): $0",
  //   "description": "A dated TODO comment"
  // },
}
